Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn方正黑体简体\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}夜行者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我迷路了\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是管制区域\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}This is a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  我不知道呢  这没有任何的告示牌\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Oh, I didn't know that. There's no signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告示牌到处都有\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的身份证给我看看\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Let's see some ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那儿有扇坏掉的大门  而你这算是非法侵入\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}There's a broken gate back there, and you're trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉  先生  那扇大门是开着的\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Excuse me, sir, that gate was open
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我只想把它当作一条捷径\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and I was under the opinion that this was a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看你的身份证  把它拿出来\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Let me see the ID. Take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么制服来着  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What kind of uniform is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快他妈回答我的问题\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'll ask the fucking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿的是便服\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}It's a private outfit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想过干你这行  我也喜欢看守东西\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I tried to get one of those jobs. I like guarding things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你  先生\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Here you go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜我接下来\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I think what must have happened
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是要转过身子...\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}is I just must have gotten turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我估计\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I guesstimate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里有大概五十磅的铜丝...\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}that I have about 50 pounds of copper wire,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.84,0:04:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,100磅的铁丝围栏．．\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}100 pounds of chain-link fence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有两水道井盖  都是做工精细又厚的那种\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and two manhole covers. The nice thick ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给铜丝出50美分\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'll give 50 cents a pound for the wire,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,围栏出15美分  井盖10美分\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}15 for the fence, and 10 for the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这比市场价低太多了\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}That's below market value.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市场价  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Market value?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有警察来问我那些井盖  我该怎么办  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}You know the cops came by asking about manhole covers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要价...每磅铜丝1美元\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'd like to counter at a dollar a pound for the copper,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每磅围栏30美分\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}30 cents a pound for the fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有20美分给那些井盖\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and 20 cents per for the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你去其他地方卖这些东西吧\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Ah, sell them somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果铜丝75美分  围栏25美分  井盖15美分\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'd feel good at 75, 25, and 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想继续跟你讨价还价了\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm not negotiating with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我觉得我们快谈好了  -我已经决定了\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}-I think we're close. -I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望我们能在建立合作关系上少花点功夫\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm willing to take less to establish a business relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是我所能最后接受的最好的价格了\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}If that's your last best offer, then I guess I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  把你的车开回去然后把那些被玩意儿扔掉\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}All right. Drive around back and unload them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  先生\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Excuse me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在找一份工作\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm looking for a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上  我已经打定主意\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}In fact, I've made up my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找一份终身的职业  能使我能从中有所学习及成长\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}to find a career that I can learn and grow into.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一个什么样的人昵  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个勤奋的人  我有远大的目标\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm a hard-worker, I set high goals
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且已经有人夸赞过我的勤奋\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}and I've been told that I am persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我不会再自暴自弃了  先生\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Now, I'm not fooling myself, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在经过一段年少轻狂自我良好的\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Having been raised with the self-esteem movement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,校园时光后...\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}so popular in schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也曾根据自身的需求细细思索\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I used to expect my needs to be considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我也清楚时下的职场文化\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}But I know that today's work culture
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再单纯的迎合着\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}no longer caters to the job loyalty that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些老一辈人所奉承的工作忠诚度\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}could be promised to earlier generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  我所相信的\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}What I believe, sir, is that good things
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是好事总会降临在那些努力工作的人身上\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}come to those who work their asses off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有那些像您这样\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}And that people such as yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,登上人生巅峰  却不会遭遇失败的人身上\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}who reach the top of the mountain, didn't just fall there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的格言就是  如果你想要赢得彩票\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}My motto is if you wanna win the lottery,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你得要先有钱去买一张\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}you have to make the money to buy a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有没有说我在一家气修厂工作过  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Did I say that I worked in a garage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你怎么看  我可以明天就开始干活或者...\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}So, what do you say? I could start tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何不干脆就今晚呢  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}or why not tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚蛋\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不实习生如何  \N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}How about an internship then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多年轻人把无薪职位  当作他们事业的敲门砖\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}A lot of young people are taking unpaid positions to get a foot in the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是我乐意做的事\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}That's something I'd be willing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈的才不会雇佣一个小偷\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I'm not hiring a fucking thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像要爆炸了\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}This thing's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  出来\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Crap! Gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像不行  坚持一下\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}This thing is not budging. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我动不了\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点走  快\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Let's go. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点走\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是第一个到的\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}We're first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  拍另外一边\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}No shit! Get a shot on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  好\N{\fe238}{\fn方正大黑简体}{\fs12}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H000000&}{\4c&H000000&}All right, all right.
